    "detailed_description": "This is a roguelike action adventure that takes players to a hidden hot spring at the far end of a dungeon.<br>In the dungeon, dangerous monsters and traps will block the player's way. It is not easy to reach the hot springs, but the player must make full use of fallen weapons and items to reach the innermost part of the dungeon.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Wonder</li></ul>The structure of the dungeon changes each time you enter it, so you never know what to expect.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Local Procurement</li></ul>You cannot bring weapons or items into the dungeon, so it is important to explore and be prepared for threats.",
